^{:go/end 66} (go/method Init "Init initializes a virtual queue descriptor for the given reserved DMA\nbuffer, which must have been prefiously created with dma.Reserve().\n" [^{:tag (* Descriptor)} d ^{:tag (slice byte)} buf ^uint16 flags]
